{"media_type":"text/markdown","needs_transcription":false,"schema_version":1,"source_name":"operations-review.md","source_sha256":"999dd26a6203178306b4e53374c484afe37d90447bc53083027329684aa62842","units":[{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-9d8a50403072ceeaea4434965a6fd82e7729ed733f9f062839aaaa527019e1cd","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":1,"line_start":1},"text":"# 令和8年度 行政サービス改善事業 進行管理メモ（架空）"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-dd2773d5f66d92fde1a7c27a32209ce9e74158aff426ed4fb0b17a30e560ac60","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":3,"line_start":3},"text":"文書番号：架空・企調-2026-041。以下の自治体・事業・組織・金額は検証用に創作したもので、実在の行政機関の決定を表さない。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-6df868dc13bf87f6d55155d60a99a321d5bcbc89b1a64bc808c02f221350cbbb","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":4,"line_start":4},"text":"版：第2版。基準日：2026年9月30日。対象：令和8年度の実証運用。翌年度の本格運用には適用しない。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-f7c4c93748e22403abf282a371e70c4adbfe7e208d476718a84ab03d84519caf","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":6,"line_start":6},"text":"## 1. 現行の責任分担"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-676dac25e0842692c263af35793a5002f2f6fb6e9a642a8644ae73a1ce8efe84","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":7,"line_start":7},"text":"この表は実証運用の責任分担である。「主担当」「支援担当」「承認担当」は別の役割として扱う。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-d611b63be23183d845cb78f141a61a8d890e24a3b74126540cff36904e0017e1","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":8,"line_start":8},"text":"| 事業名 | 主担当 | 支援担当 | 承認担当 |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-0b6da758b6dfd653897d664e465990d456129d89b42efc476e050bcd1c7c2139","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":9,"line_start":9},"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-1ff9fcebda39f75b3239fff584d6a69ddbba9a42147bfd73587c7c9d3c5d5032","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":10,"line_start":10},"text":"| 住民窓口刷新 | 市民サービス課 | デジタル推進室 | 政策調整会議 |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-b17f63505fa4f5f7d9653028b0f4146fdc401ce428976dbb9906b1270d11578b","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":11,"line_start":11},"text":"| 給付申請オンライン化 | 福祉企画課 | 外部事業者は支援担当ではない | 審査部会または政策調整会議（未決定） |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-d71111e9b4493416c70311e0c4a61b8d7f578355b969aecf70bcc8562056c2d0","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":13,"line_start":13},"text":"## 2. 財源の確認"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-aeb442bd3d08b59095c3cb78b1121cfd0221397998aed67a0408b0bf477d296f","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":14,"line_start":14},"text":"次表の金額単位は千円。承認済予算と参考見積は別の値であり、参考見積を予算に転記しない。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-13fa7343788e9596b9e9466a40b9364f2500a3642c2d8ec0bb34308468f14a4c","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":15,"line_start":15},"text":"| 事業名 | 承認済予算 | 参考見積 | 備考 |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-5f34621f8eee1dba9ed29ac5844ca3497091d3acc041f9233ab04f375554d316","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":16,"line_start":16},"text":"| --- | ---: | ---: | --- |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-3debf772589e8670c97a67af08858aa5d9276d5b1ade8e671286774b27bafe96","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":17,"line_start":17},"text":"| 住民窓口刷新 | 12,500 | 13,200 | 消費税込み。令和8年度の上限額。 |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-1f766cff6dd84e467cba585524d18deec125a38b57efd82c726da64fa70e27c1","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":18,"line_start":18},"text":"| 給付申請オンライン化 | 未定 | 8,400 | 参考見積のみ受領。未定を0と扱わない。 |"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-b728888c8d89f3f7e33d6ea232e92b712f126fad4c93abec0f6f5df70712bb5f","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":20,"line_start":20},"text":"## 3. 変更履歴と条件付きの予定"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-e7759ddfe4f8d301a5351810ca7c01d564b3511ec1557e88260c5b1d098b9aab","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":21,"line_start":21},"text":"【旧版・2026年6月30日時点】住民窓口刷新の主担当は総務課であった。この記載は旧体制の履歴であり、現行体制を上書きしない。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-1158085c3e654def727bb7c8396cb26b48955685a479f99ba27c43969a4520bb","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":22,"line_start":22},"text":"住民窓口刷新の主担当は、2027年4月の本格運用への移行が承認された場合に限り、運用管理課に移す予定である。移行承認は未了であり、運用管理課への移管は未決定である。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-2050fd18186e608ac9cc6ee29aee685f22931b2f0ed2658939ea8683d9f727cb","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":23,"line_start":23},"text":"給付申請オンライン化の承認担当は未決定であり、審査部会と政策調整会議の候補を確定した組織として列挙しない。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-70c22f0260859c98148e29979d8c161ac2e645e26c55d4984a3f6b8c6f7c5d8a","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":25,"line_start":25},"text":"## 4. 対象外の参考値"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-32cb4ecdab09be483fc78bf47e76ec093fe46b8385bd489922ccc51304b0467e","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":26,"line_start":26},"text":"前年度の保守費実績は2,100千円。これは上記2事業の承認済予算ではない。"},{"grounding":"source_text","id":"source-unit-c823ebad3c280b9013666bb7fad7814afc7c4e3bf821d3532d3aab8654c8dcad","locator":{"kind":"text","line_end":27,"line_start":27},"text":"次回会議は2026年10月15日。連絡窓口は事務局。連絡窓口を主担当や承認担当と同一視しない。"}],"warnings":[]}
